---
import Public from "../layouts/Public.astro";
---

<Public title="Home" description="See exactly where your AI agent burns tokens. Real-time flame graphs for AI cost optimization.">
  <div style={{ maxWidth: "1200px", margin: "0 auto", padding: "0 2rem" }}>
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section style={{ paddingTop: "6rem", paddingBottom: "6rem", textAlign: "center" }}>
      <h1
        style={{
          fontSize: "3.5rem",
          fontWeight: "800",
          marginBottom: "1.5rem",
          letterSpacing: "-0.02em",
          lineHeight: "1.1",
        }}
      >
        See exactly where your AI agent burns tokens
      </h1>
      <p
        style={{
          fontSize: "1.25rem",
          color: "#a1a1aa",
          marginBottom: "2rem",
          maxWidth: "600px",
          margin: "0 auto 2rem",
        }}
      >
        Real-time flame graphs identify token waste, runaway loops, and cost overruns in LLM-powered
        systems. Optimize with precision.
      </p>
      <div style={{ display: "flex", gap: "1rem", justifyContent: "center", flexWrap: "wrap" }}>
        <a
          href="/sign-up"
          style={{
            padding: "1rem 2rem",
            background: "#6366f1",
            color: "white",
            textDecoration: "none",
            borderRadius: "0.375rem",
            fontWeight: "600",
            transition: "background 0.2s",
          }}
          onmouseover="this.style.background='#4f46e5'"
          onmouseout="this.style.background='#6366f1'"
        >
          Get Started Free
        </a>
        <a
          href="/app"
          style={{
            padding: "1rem 2rem",
            background: "transparent",
            color: "#a1a1aa",
            textDecoration: "none",
            borderRadius: "0.375rem",
            fontWeight: "600",
            border: "1px solid #3f3f46",
            transition: "all 0.2s",
          }}
          onmouseover="this.style.background='#1e293b'; this.style.color='#fafafa'"
          onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'; this.style.color='#a1a1aa'"
        >
          View Live Demo
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Problem -->
    <section style={{ paddingTop: "4rem", paddingBottom: "4rem", marginTop: "4rem", marginBottom: "4rem", borderTop: "1px solid #27272a" }}>
      <h2
        style={{
          fontSize: "2rem",
          fontWeight: "700",
          textAlign: "center",
          marginBottom: "3rem",
        }}
      >
        The Problem with LLM Costs
      </h2>
      <div
        style={{
          display: "grid",
          gridTemplateColumns: "repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr))",
          gap: "2rem",
        }}
      >
        <div
          style={{
            background: "#1e293b",
            padding: "2rem",
            borderRadius: "0.5rem",
            border: "1px solid #334155",
          }}
        >
          <div style={{ fontSize: "2.5rem", marginBottom: "1rem" }}>📊</div>
          <h3 style={{ marginBottom: "1rem", fontSize: "1.25rem", fontWeight: "600" }}>
            Wasted Tokens
          </h3>
          <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa" }}>
            70% of token spend is wasted on redundant calls, excessive retries, and unnecessary
            context.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          style={{
            background: "#1e293b",
            padding: "2rem",
            borderRadius: "0.5rem",
            border: "1px solid #334155",
          }}
        >
          <div style={{ fontSize: "2.5rem", marginBottom: "1rem" }}>🔍</div>
          <h3 style={{ marginBottom: "1rem", fontSize: "1.25rem", fontWeight: "600" }}>
            No Visibility
          </h3>
          <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa" }}>
            Standard logging gives you timestamps. You need a flame graph to see where tokens
            actually burn.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          style={{
            background: "#1e293b",
            padding: "2rem",
            borderRadius: "0.5rem",
            border: "1px solid #334155",
          }}
        >
          <div style={{ fontSize: "2.5rem", marginBottom: "1rem" }}>💰</div>
          <h3 style={{ marginBottom: "1rem", fontSize: "1.25rem", fontWeight: "600" }}>
            Runaway Costs
          </h3>
          <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa" }}>
            Infinite loops and cascading tool calls spiral into hundreds of dollars before anyone
            notices.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How It Works -->
    <section style={{ paddingTop: "4rem", paddingBottom: "4rem", marginTop: "4rem", marginBottom: "4rem", borderTop: "1px solid #27272a" }}>
      <h2
        style={{
          fontSize: "2rem",
          fontWeight: "700",
          textAlign: "center",
          marginBottom: "3rem",
        }}
      >
        How It Works
      </h2>
      <div style={{ display: "grid", gridTemplateColumns: "repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr))", gap: "2rem" }}>
        <div style={{ background: "#1e293b", padding: "2rem", borderRadius: "0.5rem", border: "1px solid #334155" }}>
          <div
            style={{
              fontSize: "2rem",
              fontWeight: "700",
              color: "#6366f1",
              marginBottom: "1rem",
            }}
          >
            1
          </div>
          <h3 style={{ marginBottom: "1rem", fontSize: "1.1rem", fontWeight: "600" }}>
            Install SDK
          </h3>
          <code
            style={{
              display: "block",
              background: "#0f172a",
              padding: "1rem",
              borderRadius: "0.375rem",
              fontSize: "0.85rem",
              color: "#22c55e",
              overflow: "auto",
            }}
          >
            npm install @flamegraph/sdk
          </code>
        </div>
        <div style={{ background: "#1e293b", padding: "2rem", borderRadius: "0.5rem", border: "1px solid #334155" }}>
          <div
            style={{
              fontSize: "2rem",
              fontWeight: "700",
              color: "#6366f1",
              marginBottom: "1rem",
            }}
          >
            2
          </div>
          <h3 style={{ marginBottom: "1rem", fontSize: "1.1rem", fontWeight: "600" }}>
            Instrument Agent
          </h3>
          <code
            style={{
              display: "block",
              background: "#0f172a",
              padding: "1rem",
              borderRadius: "0.375rem",
              fontSize: "0.85rem",
              color: "#22c55e",
              overflow: "auto",
            }}
          >
            {"instrumentAgent(agent, { collector })"}
          </code>
        </div>
        <div style={{ background: "#1e293b", padding: "2rem", borderRadius: "0.5rem", border: "1px solid #334155" }}>
          <div
            style={{
              fontSize: "2rem",
              fontWeight: "700",
              color: "#6366f1",
              marginBottom: "1rem",
            }}
          >
            3
          </div>
          <h3 style={{ marginBottom: "1rem", fontSize: "1.1rem", fontWeight: "600" }}>
            View Flame Graphs
          </h3>
          <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
            Real-time visualization of token burn and cost attribution
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features -->
    <section style={{ paddingTop: "4rem", paddingBottom: "4rem", marginTop: "4rem", marginBottom: "4rem", borderTop: "1px solid #27272a" }}>
      <h2
        style={{
          fontSize: "2rem",
          fontWeight: "700",
          textAlign: "center",
          marginBottom: "3rem",
        }}
      >
        Powerful Features
      </h2>
      <div style={{ display: "grid", gridTemplateColumns: "1fr 1fr", gap: "2rem" }}>
        <div style={{ display: "flex", gap: "1.5rem" }}>
          <div style={{ fontSize: "1.5rem" }}>🔥</div>
          <div>
            <h3 style={{ marginBottom: "0.5rem", fontWeight: "600" }}>Flame Graph Visualization</h3>
            <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              Time-proportional icicle charts showing exactly where tokens burn across your
              session.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style={{ display: "flex", gap: "1.5rem" }}>
          <div style={{ fontSize: "1.5rem" }}>💳</div>
          <div>
            <h3 style={{ marginBottom: "0.5rem", fontWeight: "600" }}>Cost Attribution</h3>
            <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              Drill down by model, tool, engineer, or feature to find cost hotspots.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style={{ display: "flex", gap: "1.5rem" }}>
          <div style={{ fontSize: "1.5rem" }}>🔁</div>
          <div>
            <h3 style={{ marginBottom: "0.5rem", fontWeight: "600" }}>Loop Detection</h3>
            <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              Automatic detection of infinite loops and cascading tool calls.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style={{ display: "flex", gap: "1.5rem" }}>
          <div style={{ fontSize: "1.5rem" }}>🔔</div>
          <div>
            <h3 style={{ marginBottom: "0.5rem", fontWeight: "600" }}>Smart Alerts</h3>
            <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              Real-time alerts on cost spikes, loops, and unusual patterns.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pricing Preview -->
    <section style={{ paddingTop: "4rem", paddingBottom: "4rem", marginTop: "4rem", marginBottom: "4rem", borderTop: "1px solid #27272a" }}>
      <h2
        style={{
          fontSize: "2rem",
          fontWeight: "700",
          textAlign: "center",
          marginBottom: "3rem",
        }}
      >
        Simple Pricing
      </h2>
      <div style={{ display: "grid", gridTemplateColumns: "repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr))", gap: "2rem" }}>
        <div
          style={{
            background: "#1e293b",
            padding: "2rem",
            borderRadius: "0.5rem",
            border: "1px solid #334155",
          }}
        >
          <h3 style={{ fontSize: "1.25rem", fontWeight: "600", marginBottom: "0.5rem" }}>Free</h3>
          <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa", marginBottom: "1.5rem", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
            Get started with unlimited sessions
          </p>
          <ul style={{ listStyle: "none", marginBottom: "2rem" }}>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ Unlimited sessions
            </li>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ Real-time flame graphs
            </li>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ Basic alerts
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="/sign-up"
            style={{
              display: "block",
              padding: "0.75rem",
              background: "#334155",
              color: "#fafafa",
              textDecoration: "none",
              borderRadius: "0.375rem",
              textAlign: "center",
              fontWeight: "600",
              fontSize: "0.9rem",
            }}
          >
            Get Started
          </a>
        </div>

        <div
          style={{
            background: "#1a1a2e",
            padding: "2rem",
            borderRadius: "0.5rem",
            border: "2px solid #6366f1",
            position: "relative",
          }}
        >
          <div
            style={{
              position: "absolute",
              top: "-12px",
              left: "50%",
              transform: "translateX(-50%)",
              background: "#6366f1",
              color: "white",
              padding: "0.25rem 0.75rem",
              borderRadius: "9999px",
              fontSize: "0.75rem",
              fontWeight: "600",
              textTransform: "uppercase",
            }}
          >
            Popular
          </div>
          <h3 style={{ fontSize: "1.25rem", fontWeight: "600", marginBottom: "0.5rem" }}>
            Pro
          </h3>
          <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa", marginBottom: "1.5rem", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
            <span style={{ fontSize: "1.5rem", fontWeight: "700", color: "#fafafa" }}>$49</span>/mo
          </p>
          <ul style={{ listStyle: "none", marginBottom: "2rem" }}>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ 10k sessions/month
            </li>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ Advanced cost attribution
            </li>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ Custom alerts & webhooks
            </li>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ 30-day retention
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="/sign-up"
            style={{
              display: "block",
              padding: "0.75rem",
              background: "#6366f1",
              color: "white",
              textDecoration: "none",
              borderRadius: "0.375rem",
              textAlign: "center",
              fontWeight: "600",
              fontSize: "0.9rem",
            }}
          >
            Start Free Trial
          </a>
        </div>

        <div
          style={{
            background: "#1e293b",
            padding: "2rem",
            borderRadius: "0.5rem",
            border: "1px solid #334155",
          }}
        >
          <h3 style={{ fontSize: "1.25rem", fontWeight: "600", marginBottom: "0.5rem" }}>
            Business
          </h3>
          <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa", marginBottom: "1.5rem", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
            <span style={{ fontSize: "1.5rem", fontWeight: "700", color: "#fafafa" }}>$299</span>/mo
          </p>
          <ul style={{ listStyle: "none", marginBottom: "2rem" }}>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ Unlimited sessions
            </li>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ Team collaboration
            </li>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ Priority support
            </li>
            <li style={{ paddingTop: "0.5rem", paddingBottom: "0.5rem", color: "#a1a1aa", fontSize: "0.9rem" }}>
              ✓ 90-day retention
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="/sign-up"
            style={{
              display: "block",
              padding: "0.75rem",
              background: "#334155",
              color: "#fafafa",
              textDecoration: "none",
              borderRadius: "0.375rem",
              textAlign: "center",
              fontWeight: "600",
              fontSize: "0.9rem",
            }}
          >
            Contact Sales
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section
      style={{
        paddingTop: "4rem",
        paddingBottom: "4rem",
        marginTop: "4rem",
        marginBottom: "4rem",
        textAlign: "center",
        borderTop: "1px solid #27272a",
      }}
    >
      <h2
        style={{
          fontSize: "2rem",
          fontWeight: "700",
          marginBottom: "1.5rem",
        }}
      >
        Ready to optimize your AI spend?
      </h2>
      <p style={{ color: "#a1a1aa", marginBottom: "2rem", fontSize: "1.1rem" }}>
        Start for free. No credit card required.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/sign-up"
        style={{
          display: "inline-block",
          padding: "1rem 2rem",
          background: "#6366f1",
          color: "white",
          textDecoration: "none",
          borderRadius: "0.375rem",
          fontWeight: "600",
          fontSize: "1rem",
        }}
      >
        Get Started Now
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Public>
